### NOVA API smoke collection (P2-T5)
### Use with the "REST Client" VS Code extension or an HTTP client of your choice.
### Prereq: `pnpm dev` running at localhost:3000 and a signed-in session cookie.
###
### 1) Sign in in the browser (or via the login form), copy the `next-auth.session-token`
###    cookie, and paste it below — the placeholder @token is used by every request.

@token = paste-your-session-cookie-here
@base = http://localhost:3000/api

### ── Health / auth gates ─────────────────────────────────────────
### Expect 401 UNAUTHORIZED envelope (no destructive effect)
GET {{base}}/projects

### Expect 401
GET {{base}}/me/dashboard

### ── Register (no session needed) ────────────────────────────────
### Expect 201 { data: user } — then 409 CONFLICT when repeated
POST {{base}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Smoke Tester",
  "email": "smoke@nova.test",
  "password": "smoke-test-123"
}

### Expect 422 VALIDATION_ERROR (short password)
POST {{base}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Smoke Tester",
  "email": "smoke2@nova.test",
  "password": "short"
}

### ── Projects ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Expect 200 { data: [...] } with progress/memberCount
GET {{base}}/projects
Cookie: next-auth.session-token={{token}}

### Expect 201; creator becomes OWNER
POST {{base}}/projects
Cookie: next-auth.session-token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Smoke Project",
  "description": "Created from api.http",
  "color": "#0EA5E9"
}

### Expect 422 (name required)
POST {{base}}/projects
Cookie: next-auth.session-token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": ""
}

### Replace {{projectId}} with an id from the list above
@projectId = paste-a-project-id

### Expect 200 with stats.byStatus
GET {{base}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Cookie: next-auth.session-token={{token}}

### Non-member project: expect 403 FORBIDDEN (paste a project the session user is NOT in)
@foreignProjectId = paste-a-project-id-not-yours
GET {{base}}/projects/{{foreignProjectId}}
Cookie: next-auth.session-token={{token}}

### ── Tasks ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Expect 200 (filter combos: ?status=TODO&priority=HIGH&assigneeId=&q=)
GET {{base}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks?status=TODO
Cookie: next-auth.session-token={{token}}

### Expect 201
POST {{base}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
Cookie: next-auth.session-token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Smoke task",
  "priority": "HIGH"
}

### Replace {{taskId}} with an id from the task list
@taskId = paste-a-task-id

### Expect 200 (status change also writes TASK_MOVED + TASK_COMPLETED activity)
PATCH {{base}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Cookie: next-auth.session-token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "DONE"
}

### Expect 200 { data: { reordered } }
POST {{base}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/reorder
Cookie: next-auth.session-token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "taskIds": ["{{taskId}}"]
}

### ── Comments ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Expect 201
POST {{base}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/comments
Cookie: next-auth.session-token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Smoke comment from api.http"
}

### ── Members ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### Expect 200
GET {{base}}/projects/{{projectId}}/members
Cookie: next-auth.session-token={{token}}

### Expect 404 (user does not exist)
POST {{base}}/projects/{{projectId}}/members
Cookie: next-auth.session-token={{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ghost@nova.test"
}

### ── Activity & dashboard ────────────────────────────────────────
### Expect 200 { data: { items, nextCursor } }
GET {{base}}/projects/{{projectId}}/activity
Cookie: next-auth.session-token={{token}}

### Expect 200
GET {{base}}/me/dashboard
Cookie: next-auth.session-token={{token}}
